，服務員不夠，只有一個小女生和主廚而已，平日去也很滿座，味噌湯免費的，味道喝出很多魚肉去煮，很濃很美味，鰻魚飯也很美味，蛤蜊就沒有很好，酒味不足，味道很淡，有點像用一般開水燙熟，花椰菜也有點怪，煮得很軟，而且加了熱的胡麻醬，不太習慣，原來廚師說本來是涼菜，冬天怕客人吃菜有點冷口感，生魚片就不錯，總括來說，蘆洲有這樣的餐廳很好，可以去支持一下",null,[0,178]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6962875073595825259/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1TUZkR1ZuQmlSbXg2VFd4S1dtRnRSWGhTYWtaeFRUTlNNbGd6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6962875073595825259/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1TUZkR1ZuQmlSbXg2VFd4S1dtRnRSWGhTYWtaeFRUTlNNbGd6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6962875073595825259/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1TUZkR1ZuQmlSbXg2VFd4S1dtRnRSWGhTYWtaeFRUTlNNbGd6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6962875073595825259/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1TUZkR1ZuQmlSbXg2VFd4S1dtRnRSWGhTYWtaeFRUTlNNbGd6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6962875073595825259/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1TUZkR1ZuQmlSbXg2VFd4S1dtRnRSWGhTYWtaeFRUTlNNbGd6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6962875073595825259/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1TUZkR1ZuQmlSbXg2VFd4S1dtRnRSWGhTYWtaeFRUTlNNbGd6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2285,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5MFdGVnBiRmx6TWxKWmFtRXhSakZxTTNSMlgzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc1e0d80ff2220bbc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk90WFVpbFlzMlJZamExRjFqM3R2X3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5MFdGVnBiRmx6TWxKWmFtRXhSakZxTTNSMlgzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5MFdGVnBiRmx6TWxKWmFtRXhSakZxTTNSMlgzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5MFdGVnBiRmx6TWxKWmFtRXhSakZxTTNSMlgzYxILMGRqVjhlSXQ4cVYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rOTBXRlZwYkZsek1sSlphbUV4UmpGcU0zU